ENGLISH SUMMARY (non-binding)
────────────────────────────────────────
This repository contains only an index of third-party public API endpoints and their
availability check results. No media content is hosted, stored, or distributed.

You MAY: use it personally, study it, mirror/fork it with attribution — non-commercially.

You MAY NOT: sell it, put it behind a paywall or membership, bundle it into commercial
products or services, or use it in any commercial operation without written permission.

Provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind. Use at your own risk and in compliance
with your local laws. This is a custom Chinese-language license equivalent in scope to
CC BY-NC 4.0; where a standard text is preferred, CC BY-NC 4.0 applies.
